Package: petrovich
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, bluez-obexd
Recommends: modest
Description: Send any file over Bluetooth or by e-mail
 Petrovich lets you pick a file of your choosing, or several, and send
 them to a paired Bluetooth device (OBEX Object Push) or attach them to a
 new e-mail in Modest. A port of Faheem Pervez's Petrovich for Maemo 5 to
 Maemo Leste, where Maemo 5's sharing dialog does not exist.
XB-Maemo-Display-Name: Petrovich
